<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108568" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκλάω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>break underneath,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γούνων ὑποέκλασε δεσμά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					728
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>break by degrees, break down,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπέκλασε δεῖμα . . ἠνορέην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					4.483
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποκλώμενοι τὰς ψυχάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>BJ</u>
					7.8.7
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυμὸς ὑποκλασθείς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.215
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>enclose in a bend,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμμὴν τὴν -κλῶσαν τοὺς τρεῖς
			δακτύλους</span> (in palmistry) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				7.238
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
